# Local development needs no settings: npm run dev (Local, 5600 -> API 4600) / npm run dev:live (5700 -> 4700).
# Backend address for the dev/preview proxy — set in the shell, not in this file:
#   VITE_API_PROXY=http://localhost:4600
# Render / separately hosted build: edit .env.render, then `npm run build:render`
#   VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
